    "body": "I've made a ton of changes ;-) Here is our current WebIDL. Note, we've found at least once consumer of every single behavior within our corpus. So I would consider the below the interoperable behavior. Some of the consumers were internal.\n\n``` webidl\n    /// @specs HTML5\n    /// @tags TreeNavigation\n    interface HTMLAllCollection\n    {\n        readonly attribute unsigned long length;\n        getter Element? (unsigned long index);\n        getter (HTMLCollection or Element)? namedItem(DOMString name);\n        legacycaller (HTMLCollection or Element)? item(optional DOMString nameOrIndex);\n    };\n```\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
