    "updated_at": "2016-06-02T21:55:55Z",
    "body": "As far as I can tell based on the usage data we could get rid of the `.item()` method entirely. We'd still want to support a name-based legacycaller I guess? Although I don't understand where the difference between DocumentAllLegacyCallNamed (0-0.001%) and DocumentAllLegacyCall (~0.006%) comes from.\n",
