    "updated_at": "2016-10-20T16:07:58Z",
    "body": "I tried to make Blink match what I'd want the spec to say, but ran into exactly what @bzbarsky said in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/775#issuecomment-192414789. The array index handling is in the bindings layer, so either you'd need custom bindings or duplication of it. Given the usage and the fact that it doesn't work in Firefox, I'd be pretty hopeful about making that change in Blink.\n",
