    "body": "That's a hard question to answer free-response.  Can we make it multiple choice?  What are the options?\r\n\r\n@annevk There _may_ be a compelling benefit here, if we can minimize changes to existing UAs and have a simpler behavior.  If we can't then we can't of course.",
