    "created_at": "2018-01-13T20:58:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-01-13T20:58:46Z",
    "body": "Well, more time has passed, and per https://wpt.fyi/html/infrastructure/common-dom-interfaces/collections/htmlallcollection.html Safari now passes all but one test. It looks like this happened in https://trac.webkit.org/changeset/216851/webkit, i.e. after we made the last changes here.\r\n\r\nGiven that, I don't want to change the spec again, causing WebKit to have to change again. Since I filed this I'll also close it, but if anyone feels otherwise please ask for it to be reopened, or file a new issue for specific changes.",
